1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:00,606
Point your finger

2
00:00:00,606 --> 00:00:01,480
at something.

3
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:02,467
Shut one eye...

4
00:00:02,490 --> 00:00:03,346
now the other.

5
00:00:03,346 --> 00:00:04,833
It JUMPED!

6
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:06,070
Relax.

7
00:00:06,070 --> 00:00:07,870
One eye is the boss...

8
00:00:07,870 --> 00:00:09,750
the other's the intern.

9
00:00:09,818 --> 00:00:11,159
Each eye sees your finger

10
00:00:11,159 --> 00:00:12,450
in a different spot,

11
00:00:12,450 --> 00:00:13,468
so your brain aims

12
00:00:13,468 --> 00:00:14,951
with just one:

13
00:00:14,951 --> 00:00:16,233
the boss.

14
00:00:16,270 --> 00:00:17,114
Shut the boss,

15
00:00:17,114 --> 00:00:17,514
and you get

16
00:00:17,514 --> 00:00:19,210
the intern's picture...

17
00:00:19,210 --> 00:00:20,160
jump.

18
00:00:20,405 --> 00:00:21,509
Two in three of us

19
00:00:21,509 --> 00:00:23,870
have a right-eye boss...

20
00:00:23,870 --> 00:00:24,915
and it doesn't always

21
00:00:24,915 --> 00:00:27,091
match your writing hand.

22
00:00:27,361 --> 00:00:28,523
The intern still does

23
00:00:28,523 --> 00:00:29,450
depth...

24
00:00:29,690 --> 00:00:31,110
and winking.

